      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey... i feel like absolute crap. woke up with a super sore throat, like it hurts to even swallow, and i've got a fever that won't go down. i'm also feeling kinda lightheaded like i might pass out if i stand up too fast. im pretty sure its bacterial because it feels way worse than a normal cold... i have some amoxicillin left over from a sinus infection i had a few months ago... do u think i should just start taking that now to get ahead of it so it doesn't get worse? maybe 500mg twice a day? i rly dont wanna deal with a doctor if i can just fix it myself at home.",
